## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a scheduler that balances SLA guarantees with cost efficiency in a multi-tenant, cross-region LLM-ops environment.

## Key Concepts

- Quality of Service with per-tenant quotas and budgets
- Preemption mechanisms and priority queue management
- Cost modeling and real-time optimization dashboards
- Regional routing strategies and data locality considerations

## Code Example

